    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730958623720\" id=\"item-672c51b556b8ff4a88d03ee8\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-36a4022a956ccd72b911\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:</strong> Property Media Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans, and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Five Spacious Bedrooms:</strong> Each bedroom offers plenty of natural light and space, creating a serene retreat for family and guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Modern Bathrooms:</strong> Designed with style and practicality, the bathrooms feature quality finishes and fixtures for a touch of luxury.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Living Areas:</strong> Perfect for entertaining or quiet relaxation, the two living rooms provide versatility and ample room to unwind.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage:</strong> Enjoy secure parking and additional storage in this conveniently attached garage.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living Space:</strong> The landscaped backyard and patio are perfect for outdoor dining or unwinding in a peaceful setting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Positioned for easy access to local amenities, schools, and parks, 15 Bounty Rd brings together comfort, style, and convenience in a sought-after New Zealand location. Perfect for growing families or those looking for an upgraded lifestyle, this home invites you to experience elevated living.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspect-ratio&quot;:&quot;square&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;672c52e1e9ea726b32a3e39e&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;lightbox&quot;:false,&quot;padding&quot;:20,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;thumbnails-per-row&quot;:4,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;672c52e1e9ea726b32a3e39e&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730782483469_439040\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"672c52ef1e609b0e13e7968c\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730958069373-EIVLNEIQJ1ZWAW17F9Y2/15+Bounty+Rd+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%285%29.jpg\" alt=\"15 Bounty Rd Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Phot